      "message": "`getDefaultAvailabilityStatus()` ex https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Car/Settings/src/com/android/car/settings/wifi/WifiBasePreferenceController.java;l\u003d65?q\u003dDefaultAvailabilityStatus\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain:packages%2Fapps%2FCar%2FSettings%2Fsrc%2Fcom%2Fandroid%2Fcar%2Fsettings%2Fwifi%2F.\n\nIt determines whether a preference should be shown, enabled, disabled, etc. In the case where the metered choice can\u0027t be changed I think it makes sense to either hide or disable the setting so it isn\u0027t clickable. The different codes can be found in PreferenceController\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Car/Settings/src/com/android/car/settings/common/PreferenceController.java;l\u003d113;drc\u003d61197364367c9e404c7da6900658f1b16c42d0da;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1",
