      "writtenOn": "2025-04-23T16:38:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please override getDefaultAvailabilityStatus() and put the logic there instead. \n\n```\n    @Override\n    protected void updateState(ListPreference preference) {\n        WifiEntry wifiEntry \u003d getWifiEntry();\n        if (wifiEntry \u003d\u003d null) {\n            return;\n        }\n         preference.setValue(String.valueOf(wifiEntry.getMeteredChoice()));\n         preference.setSummary(mMeteredChoices[wifiEntry.getMeteredChoice()]);\n    }\n    \n   @Override\n    public int getDefaultAvailabilityStatus() {\n        WifiEntry wifiEntry \u003d getWifiEntry();\n        if (wifiEntry \u003d\u003d null || !wifiEntry.canSetMeteredChoice()) {\n            return CONDITIONALLY_UNAVAILABLE;\n        }\n        \n        return AVAILABLE;\n        if (wifiEntry.canSetMeteredChoice()) {\n            preference.setValue(String.valueOf(wifiEntry.getMeteredChoice()));\n            preference.setVisible(true);\n            preference.setSummary(mMeteredChoices[wifiEntry.getMeteredChoice()]);\n        } else {\n            LOG.w(\"Can\u0027t set metered choice, hidding meteredOption\");\n            setAvailabilityStatusForZone(\"hidden\");\n            refreshUi();\n        }\n    }\n```",
